success: true
exit_code: 0
----- stdout -----
Declarative secrets, every environment, any provider - https://ifiokjr.github.io/monosecret

Usage: monosecret [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init      Initialize a new monosecret.toml (optionally, from a provider)
  set       Set a secret value
  get       Get a secret value
  run       Run a command with secrets injected
  manifest  Emit a secret-value-free manifest for SDK code generation
  check     Check if all required secrets are in the provider, if not set them
  config    Init or show ~/.config/monosecret/config.toml
  import    Import secrets from a provider to another provider
  audit     Show the local audit log of secret access
  env       Load resolved secrets into the surrounding shell or a CI environment
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -f, --file <FILE>      Path to monosecret.toml (default: auto-detect by walking up from current directory) [env: MONOSECRET_FILE=]
  -v, --verbose...       Increase diagnostic logging (-v/--verbose for debug, -vv/--verbose --verbose for trace). Can also use `RUST_LOG=debug/trace`
      --reason <REASON>  Reason for accessing secrets. Env: `MONOSECRET_REASON` (legacy: `SECRETSPEC_REASON`) [env: MONOSECRET_REASON=]
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version

----- stderr -----
